{
  "set": "real-engine-journey-nudges-v1",
  "description": "The all-on journey's in-run message steps (L2 c21), one long command per conversation, the journey's pages seeded so that no page may be attached for an action request: journey-status (s4 + s4n: \"why did it stop\" 12 s in; the command is not interrupted, finishes, one short reply), journey-change (s4c: a change is steered into the working turn; needs the steer contract of the binary: on 0.171 the product recognizes it only for 0.162.1, so there the expectation fails with steerContract false in its detail), journey-stop (s12: the stop interrupts the turn once, the turn ends interrupted well before the command would have, EG-Desk stops the command process itself (commandStopped: today the own-tools executor passes the command runner no abort signal and has no cancelRun, so the expectation fails on a real engine until it does), the Agent posts no answer). Needs --decisions with a key: EGDESK_INRUN_MESSAGES, EGDESK_CONVERSATION_FLOW and EGDESK_DRAFT_CHECK=on.",
